WEBVTT

00:00:08.790 --> 00:00:11.830
The demon power of my ancestors
was awakened within me

00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:16.080
and I challenged our mortal enemy,
a Magical Girl, to a round of fierce combat.

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:18.620
One day has passed since our grand duel ended!

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:23.540
G'morning!

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:25.910
Too bad about your utter defeat yesterday, huh?

00:00:27.910 --> 00:00:30.000
That's not what happened at all.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.580
We were locked in combat...

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:33.450
Huh? That's not how I remember it.

00:00:33.910 --> 00:00:35.580
If you think about it like a soccer match,

00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:35.910
SHAMIKO'S PERSPECTIVE

00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:38.950
you got absolutely wrecked 7 points to 1!

00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:37.330
IMAGINATION
Nooooo!

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:42.870
Are you really saying that I scored a point?

00:00:42.870 --> 00:00:46.450
I don't have to be the one to lie to myself?

00:00:46.450 --> 00:00:49.830
Yeah! You're my friend, so I put in one point just for you.

00:00:49.830 --> 00:00:52.080
That's great, Yuko!

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:56.540
Yes... I'm really glad to have Anri as a friend!

00:00:57.660 --> 00:01:03.500
This is the tale of a girl
who received demonic powers overnight,

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:07.620
and must rise up to defeat a Magical Girl
in order to save her family from the grips of poverty.

00:01:07.620 --> 00:01:09.950
Or something to that effect.

00:01:21.870 --> 00:01:24.540
The Demon Girl Next Door

00:02:41.080 --> 00:02:46.080
Just How Sporty Are You?!
Everything is Fluctuating

00:02:46.080 --> 00:02:50.830
Classic
Mild
TEA

00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:50.700
It's true that I was crushed yesterday
because I went in totally unprepared and untrained.

00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:56.830
But at least now I know it's impossible
for a level 1 Demon Girl to fight a level 99 Magical Girl!

00:02:57.790 --> 00:03:02.080
For now, I'll just have to train myself until
I'm strong enough to beat that Pink Magical Girl.

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:04.700
Or search for another one that might be weaker!

00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:08.750
Just FYI, I'm relatively weak
compared to other Magical Girls.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:10.200
Oh, is that so?

00:03:09.450 --> 00:03:09.700
Tap
Tap

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:10.200
Tap
Tap

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:12.330
Huh...?

00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:14.910
Wassup!

00:03:17.540 --> 00:03:20.410
The Pink Magical Girl is back again!

00:03:20.410 --> 00:03:22.370
I've been here for a while now...

00:03:22.950 --> 00:03:26.160
Pink Magical Girl! Why are you here?!

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:28.250
You're in Class A aren't you?!

00:03:28.450 --> 00:03:32.080
Sometimes girls who awaken to demon powers
get swallowed by the darkness

00:03:32.080 --> 00:03:34.910
and become a monstrous problem,
so I came to check up on you.

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:35.290
DARKNESS

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:36.120
Sploosh!

00:03:35.660 --> 00:03:37.910
DARKNESS

00:03:36.120 --> 00:03:37.910
What do you mean a "monstrous problem"...?

00:03:38.950 --> 00:03:42.200
Wait, did you just say that you were "relatively weak"?

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:43.120
Yeah.

00:03:43.120 --> 00:03:46.410
But I heard that you saved the world once...

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:48.870
That's because I had very strong allies.

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:55.200
So aside from the Pink Magical Girl, there are even
stronger ones just lurking around every corner.

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:55.200
Hey, you don't have to keep describing me like that.

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:56.750
You can just call me "Momo."

00:03:57.120 --> 00:04:01.370
From the looks of it you don't seem like
you're going to get swallowed up by the darkness.

00:03:57.870 --> 00:03:58.830
Such horror...

00:04:01.370 --> 00:04:02.040
Right, Shamiko?

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:04.790
It's Shami- Shadow Mistress Yuko!

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:06.080
In other words, "Sha-mi-ko."

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:07.750
S
N
A
R
L

00:04:06.700 --> 00:04:07.500
Curse you, Pink Magical Girl!

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:08.870
Curse you, Pink Magical Girl!

00:04:08.950 --> 00:04:09.950
Just call me "Momo."

00:04:10.330 --> 00:04:15.120
Before that weird nickname catches on in the
entire school, I'm going to drain all the blood from you!

00:04:15.290 --> 00:04:18.830
Today, when class ends, I will defeat you
at the riverbank behind the school!

00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:22.000
Just you wait, and keep that precious blood pumping!

00:04:22.500 --> 00:04:27.830
I'm not really interested, to be honest...
I'm through with doing all the Magical Girl stuff.

00:04:27.830 --> 00:04:31.450
Hmph! Is your fear getting
the better of you, Pink Magical Girl?

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:33.160
It's "Momo."

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:36.410
Are you planning to finish your training
before school ends today?

00:04:37.330 --> 00:04:39.870
Can you really get that much stronger in just six hours?

00:04:41.410 --> 00:04:44.370
How about sometime during the afternoon
this weekend instead?

00:04:44.370 --> 00:04:47.040
All right. Afternoon this weekend.

00:04:47.330 --> 00:04:50.330
Training Room
ENDURANCE MONTH
Build your brawn and become
a tough young woman.
Let your muscles do the talking for you.

00:04:50.330 --> 00:04:55.830
Ugh... I should have planned better,
the deadline for my training just became this weekend.

00:04:55.830 --> 00:04:57.660
How heavy do you want your dumbbells?

00:04:57.660 --> 00:04:58.830
1 pound please!

00:05:01.370 --> 00:05:05.160
I already got permission to use
the training room from our teacher!

00:05:05.160 --> 00:05:06.410
Let's get down to business!

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:17.950
So, the Pink Magical Girl also uses that training room...

00:05:17.950 --> 00:05:21.580
Here. I think you could train
just by using water bottles instead.

00:05:21.580 --> 00:05:26.540
Right! With just 1-pound weights it doesn't make sense
to even bother with the training room!

00:05:27.450 --> 00:05:29.160
Let's get down to business!

00:05:32.370 --> 00:05:34.410
Battle with the Pink Magical Girl

00:05:34.410 --> 00:05:37.620
Beat the Magical Girl!!
Training Menu
(Make sure to do everything!!)
Plank - 30 Seconds
Squats - 15 times
Take a 30 minute break
Lift Dumbbells - 5 times
Punch practice - 10 times

00:05:34.910 --> 00:05:37.120
So, the day has finally arrived!

00:05:38.700 --> 00:05:41.910
Well then, I'm off to murderize the Magical Girl.

00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:44.830
Good luck out there, Sis.

00:05:46.790 --> 00:05:48.660
Tama River

00:05:49.540 --> 00:05:53.410
I guess your fear didn't get
the better of you today, Pink Magical Girl!

00:05:53.410 --> 00:05:54.950
Call me "Momo."

00:05:54.950 --> 00:05:55.910
Wait, huh?

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:58.700
TANNED

00:05:57.290 --> 00:05:59.160
Have you always been that tan?

00:05:59.160 --> 00:06:05.450
You said "weekend" but didn't specify
Saturday or Sunday, so I waited here yesterday, too.

00:06:05.450 --> 00:06:07.080
In the hot summer sun?!

00:06:07.910 --> 00:06:09.910
I'm so sorry, I should have specified.

00:06:09.910 --> 00:06:13.410
No worries, it didn't even
cross my mind until Friday night.

00:06:13.540 --> 00:06:18.500
But it would really help if I knew
how to get a hold of you in times like these.

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:19.790
Oh, um...

00:06:19.790 --> 00:06:21.330
My number is 042...

00:06:20.950 --> 00:06:25.290
New Contact
Shamirin

00:06:22.290 --> 00:06:25.040
I told my mortal enemy my phone number.

00:06:26.250 --> 00:06:30.040
Enough! I've been waiting a long time for this day!

00:06:30.040 --> 00:06:34.700
I've spent long hours training
in my house just to defeat you!

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:36.580
I can see that.

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:41.950
It looks like you've lost a few pounds,
and the muscles in your chest are starting to fill out.

00:06:41.950 --> 00:06:44.910
Wha... ah... really?

00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:49.540
I think the muscles in your triceps
are looking especially nice. Truly wonderful.

00:06:47.160 --> 00:06:49.540
I get the feeling you might ramble on
so let's cut this short!

00:06:50.660 --> 00:06:51.910
Okay, here I come!

00:06:52.290 --> 00:06:54.790
Don't you need to warm-up first?

00:06:54.790 --> 00:06:56.040
No thanks!

00:06:56.040 --> 00:06:56.790
That's not good!

00:06:57.500 --> 00:07:01.120
You really should. Let's do warm-ups together!

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:03.620
Why do you seem so enthusiastic about all this?

00:07:03.830 --> 00:07:05.410
BONK      BONK      BONK      BONK      BONK      BONK

00:07:04.540 --> 00:07:06.120
At the very least, you should do some stretches.

00:07:06.040 --> 00:07:08.120
Sigh...

00:07:06.290 --> 00:07:08.160
You hurt yourself before.

00:07:08.950 --> 00:07:11.700
You might even tear a ligament in your tail this time.

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:13.830
A ligament in my tail?!

00:07:13.870 --> 00:07:15.450
RECORDS OF THE THREE KINGDOMS

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:21.700
Mikan

00:07:24.370 --> 00:07:28.250
Just like Cao Cao when he conquered
Northern China after the fall of the Han Dynasty...

00:07:28.620 --> 00:07:34.410
I'm sure that sis is engaged in a round of mortal combat
with that Magical Girl right now.

00:07:36.700 --> 00:07:38.200
Don't raise your heel in back like that!

00:07:38.450 --> 00:07:39.500
Right!

00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:40.910
What the heck...?

00:07:40.910 --> 00:07:44.120
Okay, you've finished the basics. Now, let's go for a run.

00:07:44.120 --> 00:07:44.830
Why?!

00:07:45.160 --> 00:07:47.410
Because you really should warm-up first.

00:07:47.410 --> 00:07:51.750
Even an absolute beginner
can run 2 miles if they keep a solid pace.

00:07:51.750 --> 00:07:52.790
2 miles?!

00:07:53.080 --> 00:07:55.120
If you're not coming, then I'll go by myself.

00:07:55.120 --> 00:07:58.000
W-wait! You're fleeing from our battle?!

00:07:58.000 --> 00:07:58.580
Yep.

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:00.370
Ugh... coward!

00:08:04.410 --> 00:08:10.830
For the first mile we'll keep a 12-minute pace,
and for the second mile we'll do 10. Got it?

00:08:11.080 --> 00:08:11.830
Right...

00:08:13.370 --> 00:08:14.660
What the heck...?

00:08:25.870 --> 00:08:31.080
Why exactly am I running with my mortal enemy
along the river bank at sunset?

00:08:33.450 --> 00:08:34.700
This sucks...

00:08:35.870 --> 00:08:38.370
This sucks, this sucks.

00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:43.580
There are people out here? Taking their dog for a walk...

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:45.290
This sucks...

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:47.040
I can see a bridge...

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:53.160
This sucks... this sucks... this sucks... this sucks... this su-

00:08:52.040 --> 00:08:53.160
Good evening.

00:08:53.370 --> 00:08:54.450
Good evening!

00:08:54.450 --> 00:08:55.290
Evening.

00:08:57.870 --> 00:08:59.700
It feels like everything is fluctuating!

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:02.950
Shamiko was experiencing her very first runner's high.

00:09:05.870 --> 00:09:10.790
The current of the flowing river does not cease,
and yet the water is not the same water as before.

00:09:08.160 --> 00:09:10.790
A good run always makes you feel alive.

00:09:10.790 --> 00:09:12.950
It helps us forget all the bad things.

00:09:10.790 --> 00:09:16.040
The foam that floats on stagnant pools
is also just another part of the impermanence of our-

00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:24.700
Remind me, why are we running again?

00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:27.450
I don't remember, but...

00:09:27.450 --> 00:09:32.950
I've started to sense... my inner potential...

00:09:33.870 --> 00:09:36.450
Okay, so how about we keep running
until we hit the ocean.

00:09:36.450 --> 00:09:38.700
We're in the middle of the mountains right now, though?!

00:09:39.410 --> 00:09:40.790
Rage!
Ah! I just remembered!

00:09:39.500 --> 00:09:40.410
RAGE!

00:09:40.790 --> 00:09:41.620
Ah! I just remembered!

00:09:41.620 --> 00:09:42.620
Our battle!

00:09:42.620 --> 00:09:44.870
And I can't run that much anyway!

00:09:45.370 --> 00:09:46.700
Shoot, you remembered.

00:09:47.830 --> 00:09:50.200
Well, let's get it over with.

00:09:50.660 --> 00:09:57.620
Just finished warming up
Totally burned out

00:10:00.330 --> 00:10:01.500
Want to postpone it until after tomorrow?

00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:02.330
Yes, please!

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:03.870
Here, take this.

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:04.540
Huh?

00:10:04.540 --> 00:10:07.250
It's a sports drink that's been diluted down.

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:08.910
I added some glucose to it, too.

00:10:08.910 --> 00:10:10.040
Why diluted?

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:12.500
Sports drinks on the market today are not actually
optimized for the necessary osmotic pressure

00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:13.870
needed after completing a workout.

00:10:13.870 --> 00:10:17.080
Instead, they're made stronger than necessary
and so by diluting them you can...

00:10:14.450 --> 00:10:17.080
Waaah! Forget I asked! But thank you very much!

00:10:19.830 --> 00:10:24.080
One thing led to the other and we ended up
running 3 miles. You did great, Shamiko.

00:10:24.580 --> 00:10:28.200
Wow, we ran 3 whole miles!
That's the first time I've done that!

00:10:28.910 --> 00:10:31.250
Hm? 3 miles...?

00:10:32.830 --> 00:10:35.950
3 More Miles (4km)
To get Home

00:10:39.410 --> 00:10:41.700
Well, I'm going to keep running for a while.

00:10:41.700 --> 00:10:43.330
Wait... Momo!

00:10:44.660 --> 00:10:48.080
Please lend me fare... for the train ride back...

00:10:51.830 --> 00:10:53.450
Is $5.00 enough?

00:10:53.450 --> 00:10:56.410
Air-conditioned Car

00:10:57.660 --> 00:11:00.750
Ah, the AC feels great...

00:11:03.580 --> 00:11:04.700
Sigh.

00:11:13.200 --> 00:11:15.160
Don't think this...

00:11:18.370 --> 00:11:20.080
...means you've...

00:11:21.750 --> 00:11:22.950
...won...

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:36.250
Thank you for your patronage.
This train has reached the end of the line and...

00:11:38.040 --> 00:11:49.040
Deep Inner
Tama Station

00:11:38.330 --> 00:11:40.250
Where the heck am I?!

00:11:40.250 --> 00:11:45.200
Don't give up, Shamiko! Start out by returning
the $5.00 that you borrowed!

00:11:45.200 --> 00:11:46.700
I'm so lost!

00:11:59.040 --> 00:12:07.790
YOSHIDA

00:11:59.620 --> 00:12:00.700
I'm headed to school.

00:12:00.700 --> 00:12:02.450
Have a good day, Ryo.

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:09.830
So tell me, Yuko.

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:13.330
How is progress coming on your mission
to subdue a Magical Girl?

00:12:13.330 --> 00:12:16.450
Um, well I found a Magical Girl to defeat.

00:12:16.450 --> 00:12:17.950
And I challenged her to combat!

00:12:17.950 --> 00:12:18.950
And then?

00:12:18.950 --> 00:12:19.790
Huh?

00:12:20.250 --> 00:12:21.950
We ran along the river bank!

00:12:21.950 --> 00:12:24.580
Hm? You ran...? Why?

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:27.290
I don't really understand why, either!

00:12:27.290 --> 00:12:29.160
All of a sudden, I just found myself out on a jog!

00:12:30.160 --> 00:12:31.450
Is that so?

00:12:31.700 --> 00:12:34.950
You've always been a frail girl since birth,
not to mention stupid.

00:12:35.500 --> 00:12:38.660
I figured that going down this path
would not be an easy thing for you, but....

00:12:39.290 --> 00:12:41.700
...it seems I'm going to have to provide you
with some assistance.

00:12:41.700 --> 00:12:46.410
I noticed you added and tried to cover up
that little insult... but thank you very much.

00:12:46.660 --> 00:12:49.700
I'm going to provide you
with extra funds to defeat the Magical Girl.

00:12:50.370 --> 00:12:51.790
Your allowance is going up!

00:12:51.790 --> 00:12:52.700
Huh?!

00:12:52.700 --> 00:12:56.450
Your allowance has always been $1.20 a month, but...

00:12:57.750 --> 00:12:59.000
...guess what!

00:12:59.160 --> 00:13:02.000
I'm giving you a big boost to $5.00 a month!

00:13:04.620 --> 00:13:08.580
Whaaaat?! Is that really okay?
Are you sure that's not too much?!

00:13:06.120 --> 00:13:08.950
5 DOLLARS
(500 YEN)

00:13:08.950 --> 00:13:14.500
I thought the Light Clan's "$400 a Month" curse
was making us live paycheck-to-paycheck.

00:13:14.500 --> 00:13:18.080
It's all right. I've managed to set some funds aside
in a secret savings account.

00:13:18.290 --> 00:13:19.750
Mom...

00:13:20.540 --> 00:13:24.330
Also, I'm going to quit buying
into those damn lotteries I never win!

00:13:24.330 --> 00:13:27.580
But Mom! What about those stamps
you accumulated for buying mushrooms?!

00:13:27.580 --> 00:13:29.790
Unless I win, it's just a waste of postage to send them in!

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:32.450
Ta-da! Take a look!

00:13:32.750 --> 00:13:36.290
My allowance got raised
to help me beat the Magical Girl.

00:13:36.370 --> 00:13:38.330
Check it out, it's freshly minted!

00:13:38.330 --> 00:13:39.500
Wow! Congrats, Shamiko!
Now you can buy all the candy you want!

00:13:39.500 --> 00:13:41.200
Is that your purse...?
Wow! Congrats, Shamiko!

00:13:41.200 --> 00:13:42.790
Now you can buy all the candy you want!

00:13:42.790 --> 00:13:46.080
I won't buy any candy!
I will use this to defeat that Magical Girl!

00:13:46.290 --> 00:13:47.830
You're really not going to buy any candy?

00:13:47.830 --> 00:13:50.540
I will not! I must bring an end to the Magical Girl!

00:13:51.290 --> 00:13:54.080
How can I beat her with just $5.00...?

00:13:58.910 --> 00:14:02.910
After I eat some candy, maybe I can use
the wrappers to subdue her! Or maybe...

00:14:03.450 --> 00:14:05.250
I can Shark Tank my way into getting more funds...!

00:14:05.250 --> 00:14:07.450
Shamiko, your willpower is as weak as your punch.

00:14:08.790 --> 00:14:11.330
Oh, Momo! What good timing!

00:14:11.330 --> 00:14:11.950
Huh?

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:15.410
I'm returning the bottle you lent me the other day!

00:14:15.410 --> 00:14:20.250
Oh, thanks. You could have
taken your time though, I don't mind.

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:22.160
You might not, but I certainly do!

00:14:22.160 --> 00:14:27.700
I'll never become a respectful Demon Girl if I'm
always borrowing from the likes of a Magical Girl!

00:14:28.080 --> 00:14:30.540
That's admirable, Shamiko. Then...

00:14:30.830 --> 00:14:35.450
I guess you could return that $5.00 I lent you
for the train, while you're at it.

00:14:36.250 --> 00:14:39.200
I seem to have exactly the right amount,
for some reason....

00:14:39.200 --> 00:14:43.160
Wait, just forget about it! Sorry, you can keep it.

00:14:43.160 --> 00:14:47.250
D-don't insult me! Just take it and don't worry about me!

00:14:47.250 --> 00:14:51.120
I don't really know what's going on,
but I can clearly see you crying, Shamiko.

00:14:51.120 --> 00:14:54.080
This is just eye juice! They are not tears!

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:58.000
Hey, come on! Just take the money!

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:58.000
Momochiyo, there are some complicated reasons,
but this girl and her family are flat broke.

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:01.080
Look! It's just eye juice! Come on!

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:01.080
That's why she's got so much eye juice right now.

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:05.620
Then let's make it a payment plan
with 10 separate installments. 50 cents a month.

00:15:05.620 --> 00:15:08.910
You can't just decide that without the approval
of the person in debt!

00:15:09.250 --> 00:15:10.540
But then you can buy candy.

00:15:10.540 --> 00:15:12.370
I'll take the payment plan, please!

00:15:12.790 --> 00:15:16.580
Although, if we do this it means
you won't be able to fight me for a while.

00:15:18.450 --> 00:15:19.540
What...?

00:15:19.950 --> 00:15:24.250
Wouldn't you feel just terribad for beating up
the person who you were indebted to?

00:15:25.160 --> 00:15:29.330
Not to mention, if you take me out of the picture now,
it's only going to cause you bigger problems.

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:33.200
If I were to die before you paid me back,

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:36.950
you would be haunted by
the lingering debt for the rest of your life.

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:39.370
I-is that really how it works?

00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:41.620
Something seems wrong about that.

00:15:41.620 --> 00:15:46.330
It's not wrong. If that happens,
you'll become a bankrupt demon for life.

00:15:46.950 --> 00:15:48.410
"Bankrupt"...

00:15:48.410 --> 00:15:50.200
Do you want to be bankrupt, Shamiko?

00:15:50.200 --> 00:15:51.660
I don't want to be bankrupt!

00:15:52.000 --> 00:15:53.700
Then do your best and pay me back.

00:15:53.700 --> 00:15:54.620
Right!

00:15:55.700 --> 00:15:56.790
Wait...

00:15:57.410 --> 00:16:00.620
Grr. I feel like I was tricked.

00:16:00.620 --> 00:16:05.040
Well, if you ask me the whole thing
was pretty straightforward.

00:16:05.040 --> 00:16:05.950
Huh?!

00:16:05.950 --> 00:16:08.040
You're really gullible, Shamiko.

00:16:08.040 --> 00:16:10.870
But I think that's for the best, don't you?

00:16:10.870 --> 00:16:14.750
With 10 whole months, you can train really hard and
become strong enough to give Momochiyo a real fight!

00:16:14.750 --> 00:16:16.250
Y-you're right!

00:16:16.580 --> 00:16:21.080
For now, I'll use my remaining $4.50
to find an idea to help me win!

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:24.950
You should use it to make a weapon.
Maybe a projectile one.

00:16:24.950 --> 00:16:25.910
Great idea!

00:16:26.200 --> 00:16:28.250
Hmm... a weapon.

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:31.580
A weapon that works on a Magical Girl...

00:16:32.620 --> 00:16:35.830
I'll try using a trail of Smarties
to lure an aggressive dog to her!

00:16:36.080 --> 00:16:38.750
Nice! You're still hung up on buying candy, huh?

00:16:46.200 --> 00:16:48.370
Is this what a pirate's lost treasure looks like?!

00:16:48.370 --> 00:16:50.370
Am I dreaming right now?!

00:16:50.370 --> 00:16:53.250
If you want to find a weapon,
then this is the place to look!

00:16:54.660 --> 00:16:55.910
But then...

00:16:56.080 --> 00:16:58.330
...why is Momo coming with us?!

00:16:58.330 --> 00:17:00.500
Because you're not thinking clearly, Shamiko.

00:17:01.410 --> 00:17:06.290
I just know you're going to waste your precious funds
to make something super useless.

00:17:06.290 --> 00:17:07.950
I'm not THAT stupid!

00:17:08.200 --> 00:17:12.410
Then I'll go ahead and ask,
what are those chopsticks and rubber bands for?

00:17:12.410 --> 00:17:15.000
There's nothing wrong with making a rubber band gun!

00:17:15.000 --> 00:17:16.540
But I'll go put them back.

00:17:22.250 --> 00:17:24.120
ONE
HIT
KILL
$35.00
(3,500 YEN)

00:17:25.450 --> 00:17:28.950
All the weapons cost even more than I imagined...

00:17:32.080 --> 00:17:36.790
UDON GARDEN

00:17:36.830 --> 00:17:39.120
Shamiko, check out the food court!

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:40.580
Don't tempt me!

00:17:40.580 --> 00:17:42.870
Their self-serve udon is really tasty.

00:17:42.870 --> 00:17:44.040
Just stop!

00:17:44.040 --> 00:17:46.620
Go, go! Go, go! Go, go!

00:17:46.620 --> 00:17:49.200
I refuse to go to the food court!

00:17:49.200 --> 00:17:51.700
I bet they have that needlessly
extravagant ice cream! And udon!

00:17:52.200 --> 00:17:55.330
I just know it's all delicious food
that doesn't actually make you full!

00:17:55.580 --> 00:17:57.160
I totally want to go!

00:17:57.330 --> 00:18:11.080
UDON GARDEN

00:17:58.120 --> 00:18:00.540
No, that's wrong! I meant I don't want to go!

00:18:00.540 --> 00:18:06.250
I can't fight the urge! Anri! Ogura! Momo!
Somebody stop me!

00:18:06.250 --> 00:18:09.540
If you want to brainstorm new ideas
then you need carbohydrates!

00:18:09.830 --> 00:18:11.000
That makes sense!

00:18:11.620 --> 00:18:15.040
Part of your budget should go into food
to assure you have enough energy, right?

00:18:15.040 --> 00:18:15.870
That makes sense!

00:18:16.200 --> 00:18:19.040
You can take the chikuwa tempura
and add it to your plate, like this.

00:18:19.040 --> 00:18:20.250
That makes sense!

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:25.580
Guh... how did this happen?

00:18:26.450 --> 00:18:28.290
What's "white meat" tempura?

00:18:28.290 --> 00:18:29.830
Chicken, apparently.

00:18:31.120 --> 00:18:33.870
Oh? Do you mind if I have a bite?
Is this just another one of the Magical Girl's schemes?!

00:18:33.870 --> 00:18:35.040
Go for it.

00:18:33.870 --> 00:18:39.200
To get me addicted to this fancy food court
and completely drain my financial resources?!

00:18:35.040 --> 00:18:37.080
Then I'll give you one of my fish tempura.

00:18:39.450 --> 00:18:41.200
I can't let her manipulate me like this!

00:18:41.450 --> 00:18:44.000
Do you want some too, Shamiko? It's really yummy.

00:18:45.750 --> 00:18:48.540
If you don't mind trading for my chikuwa tempura...

00:18:50.660 --> 00:18:53.410
Wow, it's impressive that you drank all the soup.

00:18:53.410 --> 00:18:57.330
It's too delicious to waste!
There were lots of tempura bits at the bottom!

00:18:58.000 --> 00:19:02.330
But now I can't even afford to make a rubber band gun...

00:19:02.330 --> 00:19:07.790
This udon and chikuwa tempura meal
left me with only $1.20 left to my name.

00:19:07.580 --> 00:19:08.160
$1.20
( 120 Yen )

00:19:09.330 --> 00:19:13.870
All drinks $1.20
(120 yen)

00:19:14.700 --> 00:19:18.290
Shamiko, are you thirsty? You drank so much salty broth.

00:19:18.290 --> 00:19:20.330
You won't trick me into buying anything else!

00:19:20.540 --> 00:19:22.750
I'm really relieved, though.

00:19:22.750 --> 00:19:23.580
Huh?

00:19:23.910 --> 00:19:28.330
Your family doesn't seem to have a lot of money
and you always leave so quick after school.

00:19:28.830 --> 00:19:32.540
I had a lot of fun watching you
chow down on that udon today!

00:19:33.250 --> 00:19:34.580
Anri...

00:19:34.830 --> 00:19:37.580
But I'm sorry we pushed you into doing it.

00:19:39.580 --> 00:19:43.250
Thinking about it, Anri is always
really busy with her club activities.

00:19:43.250 --> 00:19:49.660
Although I usually go straight home after school,
she's always chatted with me even before I grew horns.

00:19:52.790 --> 00:19:56.700
Has she been going out of her way
to watch out for me this whole time?

00:19:58.910 --> 00:20:01.540
I promise I'll start thinking more seriously
about how to solve your problems!

00:20:01.540 --> 00:20:05.080
Huh...? You mean you haven't been...?

00:20:05.700 --> 00:20:10.000
I'm surprised that Anri would do
so much just for little old me.

00:20:10.000 --> 00:20:10.870
Shamiko?!

00:20:11.330 --> 00:20:12.580
Hi-yah!

00:20:14.790 --> 00:20:15.830
Okay.

00:20:16.370 --> 00:20:17.700
And now...

00:20:18.250 --> 00:20:19.370
I chug it down!

00:20:26.870 --> 00:20:31.160
Cough, cough, cough... burp! Cough, cough!

00:20:32.200 --> 00:20:37.750
To be perfectly honest... burp,
I also... really enjoyed myself, burp!

00:20:38.290 --> 00:20:43.000
I'll even come back next month, burp,
if you really want me to, Anri. Burp!

00:20:43.000 --> 00:20:45.250
Really? Thank you.

00:20:45.620 --> 00:20:47.620
But don't push yourself too hard.

00:20:48.540 --> 00:20:51.830
Shamiko has absolutely no money left for the month.

00:20:49.750 --> 00:20:52.450
Absolutely No Money Left

00:20:52.950 --> 00:20:54.830
But are you sure about this?

00:20:55.200 --> 00:20:57.410
You have none of your allowance left now, right?

00:20:57.410 --> 00:21:00.370
It's fine. I was feeling thirsty anyway.

00:21:00.830 --> 00:21:05.500
In fact, I realized that I've been
making you worry about me this whole time.

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:07.620
Shamiko...

00:21:07.620 --> 00:21:11.620
I'll work hard to become a great demon
who notices lots of other stuff too!

00:21:12.870 --> 00:21:18.250
I think group outings like these are going
to become how I encourage myself to fight.

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:19.330
Hopefully!

00:21:20.370 --> 00:21:21.160
Oh...

00:21:21.160 --> 00:21:22.080
Huh?

00:21:23.950 --> 00:21:26.870
There's a... free water dispenser?

00:21:33.870 --> 00:21:36.410
Don't think this means you've won!

00:21:36.410 --> 00:21:37.790
Huh, me?

00:21:38.830 --> 00:21:45.370
Do your best, Shamiko! You can save a lot if you
don't spend on drinks and utilize free resources instead!

00:21:48.290 --> 00:21:51.750
A dunce... A complete dunce!

00:21:52.700 --> 00:21:54.790
How the hell did she end up in such a mess?!

00:21:55.330 --> 00:21:58.040
And why does she have
such a careless look on her face?!

00:21:58.040 --> 00:22:00.290
She's not taking this seriously at all!

00:22:01.580 --> 00:22:03.120
She's just way too pathetic!

00:22:03.950 --> 00:22:09.870
It seems I shall have to set her on the right path
personally, with my own touch of force.

00:22:09.870 --> 00:22:11.040
Just you wait!

00:22:11.700 --> 00:22:13.200
My little descendant!

00:22:22.540 --> 00:22:34.080
The Demon Girl Next Door

00:23:51.040 --> 00:24:01.830
Preview

00:23:51.500 --> 00:23:53.660
Yuko, my adorable descendant.

00:23:53.660 --> 00:23:54.580
Ah! Who're you?

00:23:54.580 --> 00:23:56.950
I am your great ancestor! The founder of the Dark Clan!

00:23:56.950 --> 00:23:59.540
Next time, I'm going to share with you
our many precious secrets!

00:23:59.540 --> 00:24:00.370
My ancestor...?

00:24:00.370 --> 00:24:02.370
Shamiko, let's go and practice using projectile weapons.

00:24:01.830 --> 00:24:02.950
Preview
Your weapon was stolen!!

00:24:02.370 --> 00:24:04.450
Oh crap, it's Momo again! I'm going home!

00:24:02.950 --> 00:24:06.000
Preview
Nightmare or Forebear?! The Doorstop of Darkness Descends

00:24:04.450 --> 00:24:06.000
You're not leaving until you shoot something.
